{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[G]Holy are You, Lord, holy are You, Lord,
You are [Csus2]holy
When [Am7]I can't see or [Csus2]feel You,
You remain the [G]same
[G]Holy are You, Lord, holy are You, Lord,
You are [Csus2]holy
When [Am7]I can't see or [Csus2]feel You,
You remain the [G]same
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
I am a[G]mazed by Your [Csus2]grace
Your mercies are [G]new every [Csus2]day
You fill my [G]life with the [Csus2]goodness of Your [Dsus4]love
Come and [G]pour down through [Csus2]me
Use me in [G]ways I cannot [Csus2]see
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Tag 1}
[Am7]Oh [Csus2]
You are [G]holy
[Am7]Oh [Csus2]
Lord, You are [G]holy
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[G]Awesome are Your ways
[G]Awesome are Your ways
You are [Csus2]awesome
My [Am7]words can't contain
The [Csus2]wonders of Your ways
You are [G]awesome
{end_of_verse}

{chorus}

{start_of_verse: Tag 2}
[Am7]Oh [Csus2]
You are [G]awesome
[Am7]Oh [Csus2]
Lord, You are [G]awesome
{end_of_verse}

{chorus}

{start_of_verse: Tag 2}
[Am7]Oh [Csus2]
You are [G]awesome
[Am7]Oh [Csus2]
Lord, You are [G]awesome
{end_of_verse}
